register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 1mL @ 25C
add v2 water 100mL @ 25C
add v1 NaCl 0.000001mol
add v2 NaCl 0.0001mol
measure v1 volume
measure v2 volume
measure v1 conductivity
measure v2 conductivity
measure v1 density
measure v2 density
